/* MARK: - Connection health and diagnostics */
"An inactive session means Roam Control's worker has ended. Other apps may need time to acquire a fresh real location." = "会话未运行表示 Roam Control 的后台进程已结束，其他 App 可能需要一些时间才能获取新的真实位置。";
"Another VPN may affect local device connections. If it is appropriate for your network, compare a test with that VPN paused. Keep LocalDevVPN enabled when starting a location session." = "其他 VPN 可能会影响本地设备连接。如果适合你的网络环境，可在暂停该 VPN 后对比测试。启动定位会话时请保持 LocalDevVPN 开启。";
"Check pairing and the local connection without changing your location. You can also share a readable diagnostics report." = "在不改变定位的情况下检查配对和本地连接。你还可以分享一份易读的诊断报告。";
"Copies a status-only report you can paste into a bug report. It never includes locations, searches, pairing records, PINs, device names or error text." = "拷贝一份仅含状态的报告，可粘贴到问题反馈中。其中绝不包含位置、搜索、配对记录、PIN、设备名称或错误文本。";
"Roam Control has not detected another VPN. This is a troubleshooting check, not a diagnosis; an iOS scheduler rejection happens before the pairing connection starts." = "Roam Control 未检测到其他 VPN。这只是一项排查检查，并非诊断结论；iOS 调度器的拒绝发生在配对连接开始之前。";
"The secure location session is active and responding." = "安全定位会话运行中且响应正常。";
"This checks the saved pairing record and whether the paired iPhone is visible through LocalDevVPN. It never starts, changes, or stops your location." = "这会检查已保存的配对记录，以及能否通过 LocalDevVPN 看到已配对的 iPhone。它绝不会启动、更改或停止你的定位。";
"This iPhone is not paired. Open Pairing & Connection and pair it first." = "这台 iPhone 尚未配对。请打开“配对与连接”先完成配对。";
"This iPhone was not reachable through LocalDevVPN. Check that the tunnel is connected. On mobile data, switch data off briefly and run the check again." = "无法通过 LocalDevVPN 连接这台 iPhone。请检查隧道已连接。使用移动数据时，请短暂关闭数据后再次运行检查。";
"This iPhone's pairing service is reachable through LocalDevVPN. Secure session verification happens when you start a location session." = "可通过 LocalDevVPN 连接这台 iPhone 的配对服务。安全会话验证会在你启动定位会话时进行。";
"Stop command acknowledged; real location reacquisition unverified" = "停止命令已确认；真实定位的重新获取尚未验证";
"Stop not confirmed; real location unverified" = "停止未确认；真实定位未验证";
"Stop requested; awaiting device response" = "已请求停止；正在等待设备响应";

/* MARK: - Settings, privacy and reset */
"Apple Maps in mainland China uses shifted (GCJ-02) coordinates. Roam Control converts them back to WGS-84 before they are sent to this iPhone, so the simulated position matches the place you chose. Turn this off to send coordinates exactly as they are." = "Apple 地图在中国大陆使用偏移后的 GCJ-02 坐标。Roam Control 会在下发到这台 iPhone 之前还原为 WGS-84，让模拟位置落在你选择的地点上。关闭后将按原值下发。";
"Checks the public GitHub release only when you tap it. Roam Control never sends location, pairing or diagnostic data with this request." = "仅在你轻点时检查 GitHub 上的公开版本。此请求绝不会发送定位、配对或诊断数据。";
"Correct Mainland China Coordinates" = "修正中国大陆坐标";
"Erase the pairing record and all saved app choices, then return to onboarding. LocalDevVPN itself is not changed." = "抹掉配对记录和所有已保存的 App 选项，然后返回引导页。LocalDevVPN 本身不会改变。";
"Every favourite will be removed. Your history will be kept." = "所有收藏都将被移除，历史记录会保留。";
"Every recently used location will be removed. Your favourites will be kept." = "所有最近使用的地点都将被移除，收藏会保留。";
"GitHub may ask you to choose Bug Report or Feature Request first. For pairing or connection problems, open Connection Health and use Copy Diagnostics. Do not include pairing records, credentials or private locations." = "GitHub 可能会先让你选择“问题反馈”或“功能建议”。如遇配对或连接问题，请打开“连接状况”并使用“拷贝诊断信息”。请勿包含配对记录、凭据或私人位置。";
"Optional and off by default. Helps estimate activity from participating installations. Locations, searches and pairing data are never included." = "可选且默认关闭。用于估算参与安装的活动量。绝不包含位置、搜索和配对数据。";
"Roam Control uses the language set on this iPhone unless you choose one here. Changing the language takes effect after the app restarts." = "除非你在此处选择，否则 Roam Control 使用这台 iPhone 设定的语言。更改语言将在 App 重启后生效。";
"Roam Control will use the new language the next time it opens." = "Roam Control 将在下次打开时使用新语言。";
"Roam Control is intended for location-based app development and testing on your own device." = "Roam Control 旨在用于在你自己设备上进行基于定位的 App 开发与测试。";
"This clears the pairing record and local app settings, then shows onboarding again. It does not remove or change LocalDevVPN." = "这会清除配对记录和本地 App 设置，然后重新显示引导页。它不会移除或更改 LocalDevVPN。";
"This cannot be undone." = "此操作无法撤销。";
"View onboarding again without deleting your pairing, favourites, history or preferences." = "重新查看引导页，不会删除你的配对、收藏、历史记录或偏好设置。";
"Your pairing record and local choices will be removed. You will return to the welcome screen." = "你的配对记录和本地选择将被移除，并返回欢迎界面。";

