"A random identifier is created for this installation and irreversibly hashed before it is sent. It is used only to estimate activity from participating installations." = "系统会为本安装创建一个随机标识符，并在发送前进行不可逆的哈希处理，仅用于估算参与安装的活动量。";
"App opened or returned to foreground" = "App 打开或回到前台";
"App version and build" = "App 版本和构建号";
"Apple ID, device name or personal details" = "Apple ID、设备名称或个人资料";
"Approximate event time" = "大致的事件时间";
"Background session support, permission status and scheduler availability" = "后台会话支持、权限状态和调度器可用性";
"Connection help, retry and retry success counts" = "连接帮助、重试和重试成功的次数";
"Coordinates or place names" = "坐标或地点名称";
"Events are sent to Roam Control's maintainer-operated service and, in configured beta builds, TelemetryDeck. The self-hosted service receives ordinary HTTPS connection metadata, such as the source IP address, but the app does not include it in the event body." = "事件会发送到 Roam Control 由维护者运营的服务；在已配置的测试版中还会发送到 TelemetryDeck。自建服务会收到常规的 HTTPS 连接元数据（例如来源 IP 地址），但 App 不会将其包含在事件正文中。";
"Fixed failure stage, scheduler reason, operation and recovery category" = "固定的失败阶段、调度器原因、操作和恢复类别";
"Fixed or walking session started" = "已启动固定或步行会话";
"Fixed pairing and location task configuration and registration states on scheduler failures" = "调度器失败时固定的配对与定位任务配置及注册状态";
"Full diagnostic reports" = "完整诊断报告";
"Hashed random installation identifier" = "经过哈希处理的随机安装标识符";
"Installed app and permitted background-task identifiers on scheduler failures (maintainer service only)" = "调度器失败时已安装的 App 和允许的后台任务标识符（仅维护者服务）";
"Introduction completed" = "已完成介绍";
"iOS version (maintainer service only)" = "iOS 版本（仅维护者服务）";
"Pairing completed" = "已完成配对";
"Pairing records or PINs" = "配对记录或 PIN";
"Raw error messages or credentials" = "原始错误消息或凭据";
"Roam Control sends only a small, fixed set of anonymous activity counts when sharing is enabled." = "开启共享时，Roam Control 只会发送一小组固定的匿名活动计数。";
"Roam Control uses a narrow first-party sender instead of an analytics SDK, so extra device metadata is not added automatically." = "Roam Control 使用范围很窄的自有发送组件，而不是分析 SDK，因此不会自动附加额外的设备元数据。";
"Searches, favourites, history or routes" = "搜索、收藏、历史记录或路线";
"The self-hosted service runs daily maintenance that deletes live events older than 90 days. No fixed deletion schedule is promised for database backups or web-server access logs. TelemetryDeck says it does not store IP addresses and may retain anonymous events for roughly 7–10 years without guaranteeing an exact deletion date." = "自建服务每天执行维护，删除超过 90 天的实时事件。数据库备份或 Web 服务器访问日志没有固定的删除时间承诺。TelemetryDeck 表示其不存储 IP 地址，匿名事件可能保留约 7–10 年，且不保证确切的删除日期。";

